      "disambiguatingDescription": "Data Analyst specialising in SQL, business intelligence, Python ETL and geospatial transport analytics, with a prior decade in ISO-regulated quality assurance.",
      "description": "Data Analyst with 2.5 years dedicated to data work in passenger transport and telecommunications, holding a BSc in Software Engineering (Universitat Oberta de Catalunya, July 2026, taught entirely in English, GPA 8.28/10). Covers the full cycle: extraction and modelling in Oracle, PostgreSQL and SQL Server; ETL and automation in Python; delivery in Tableau, Power BI and advanced Excel. Two distinguishing specialisations: geospatial transport analytics (QGIS, OSRM, GTFS, route-adherence analysis from geolocation) and data quality, drawn from ten prior years as a quality and audit technician under ISO 9001, 17020, 17025 and 22000. Builds pipelines with pre-load validation and input–output reconciliation rather than transformation alone.",
