          "startDate": "2024-02",
          "endDate": "2024-11",
          "description": "Real-time performance monitoring of three concurrent contact-centre campaigns — Legálitas (legal services), Iberdrola (energy) and insurance — on the corporate omnichannel platform. Automated eight daily reports in Power BI and Excel summarising campaign performance for direct distribution to clients. Defined and tracked operational and sales KPIs: contactability, abandon rate, conversion, average handling time and average time to sale. Analysed lead profitability against acquisition price and attempt count, and compared fractional versus single-block purchasing of contact databases, producing a recommendation on purchasing strategy. Administered campaign databases in Microsoft SQL Server and Microsoft Access and automated recurring processes in Python.",
